Data provenance
===============

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the CODE in this repository. It does not
cover tennis data, and no tennis data is distributed here. Every dataset the
model reads is fetched by the user from its own source, under that source's
own terms.

This file exists so the position is explicit rather than implied.


Sources the code reads
----------------------

