Recent results, newer than the archive snapshot
    Scraped from tennisabstract.com by tools/ta/. No licence is granted for
    that content and none of it is redistributed here — only the fetching and
    parsing code. Respect the site; the fetcher is rate-limited for a reason.

Historical weather
    Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com), ERA5 reanalysis by Copernicus Climate Change
